"Ox mtDNA"],["activation","Ox mtDNA generation and pDC activation: Ox mtDNA was generated as previously described. Briefly, healthy neutrophils were pre-incubated with IFNα2β (2000 U/ml; Schering Corp.) for 90 min at 370C and then extensively washed before incubation with anti-RNP IgG (50 μg/ml) purified from SLE patient sera. Neutrophil supernatants were then collected, centrifuged for 10 min at 1400g and stored at -80C. PDCs (5x105 cells/well – 96 U bottom plate) were cultured with 40% v/v Ox mtDNA-containing neutrophil supernatants (referred in the text as “Ox mtDNA”) or with 5 μg/ml of either CpGA (ODN-2216; Invivogen) for 24 h. The volume of Ox mtDNA-containing neutrophil supernatants and the concentration of CpGA were selected based on their capacity to trigger similar levels of IFNα production by pDCs."],["project","1"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR6652767","experiment_accession":"SRX3630249","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 2500","read_count":22581971,"base_count":3342793806,"first_public":"2018-09-27","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 2500 sequencing: GSM2971176: N_III_S9 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN08436870","study_accession":"PRJNA432168","blood_class":"blood_cells","class_from":"sample","title":"N_II_S8","description":"N_II_S8","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM2971175","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2018-09-27","attributes":[["source_name","T-cells"],["tissue","T-cells"],["subject id","II"],["diagnosis","healthy control"],["treatment","Ox mtDNA"],["activation","Ox mtDNA generation and pDC activation: Ox mtDNA was generated as previously described. Briefly, healthy neutrophils were pre-incubated with IFNα2β (2000 U/ml; Schering Corp.) for 90 min at 370C and then extensively washed before incubation with anti-RNP IgG (50 μg/ml) purified from SLE patient sera. Neutrophil supernatants were then collected, centrifuged for 10 min at 14